agy-bridge — Universal Cross-Agent Project & Session Orchestrator for macOS (v0.2 Full-Fidelity).
Bridges:
  1. Antigravity 2.0 (v2.29.0+ via LanguageServerService HTTP RPC + agentapi + ~/.gemini)
  2. Claude Desktop & Claude Code (~/.claude/projects, ~/Library/Application Support/Claude, /tmp/cc-socks, claude CLI)
  3. OpenAI Codex (~/.codex/.codex-global-state.json, ~/.codex/state_5.sqlite, ~/.codex/sessions)
  4. WorkBuddy (~/.workbuddy/projects)

Subcommands:
  status | list     List active projects, live sockets, and recent sessions across all 4 agents
  spawn-agy         Create/register project (Turbo/Allow/Eager) + Codex + optional new Antigravity chat
  send-agy          Send message to an existing Antigravity conversation (by cascade_id or project)
  spawn-claude      Create/register project + launch/prepare Claude Code / Desktop session
  send-claude       Send message directly into an open Claude Desktop / CLI tab via Unix socket (/tmp/cc-socks)
  handoff           Transfer full-fidelity session context between Claude, Antigravity, Codex, and WorkBuddy
  sync              3-layer lossless sync: CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md auto-state + HANDOFF_CONTEXT.md + .agy-bridge/sessions/
  hook-sync         Zero-click lifecycle hook handler for Claude Code (Stop) and Antigravity 2.0 (Stop)
  install-hooks     Install global auto-sync hooks and cross-agent rules for Claude & Antigravity
  focus             Focus an Antigravity conversation in the UI (SmartFocusConversation)
"""
